Title: The Last Light
Credit: Written by
Author: ShotPilot Demo
Draft date: Demo script — fictional content for testing

FADE IN:

1 EXT. AL-ULA DESERT ROAD - DAWN 1

An empty road cuts through red sandstone. A dusty pickup truck rattles toward camera, kicking up a trail of dust.

Aerial shot: the truck is a tiny dot in an ocean of rock.

NOURA (30s), a photographer, drives. A camera bag rides shotgun.

NOURA (V.O.)
My father said the light here remembers everything.

2 INT. PICKUP TRUCK - MOVING - DAWN 2

Close on Noura's hands on the wheel. A faded photograph is tucked into the sun visor.

NOURA
(to herself)
One more frame. Just one.

Her phone buzzes. The screen reads: SAMI.

3 EXT. ROCK FORMATION - DAY 3

Noura sets up a tripod beside the truck. SAMI (40s), her brother, arrives on foot, out of breath, carrying two bottles of water.

SAMI
You left before anyone woke up.

NOURA
The light doesn't wait.

A falcon circles overhead. Sami watches it, uneasy.

SAMI
Mother wants you home before night.

4 INT. FAMILY HOUSE - MAJLIS - NIGHT 4

A warm majlis lit by lanterns. Guests sip coffee. UMM NOURA (60s) pours from a dallah.

UMM NOURA
She is her father's daughter.

SAMI
That's what worries me.

5 EXT. ROCK FORMATION - NIGHT 5

Noura alone under a sky full of stars. Smoke drifts from a small fire. She climbs onto the rooftop of the truck to get the angle.

NOURA
There you are.

She presses the shutter. The frame freezes.

FADE OUT.
